# Valkey users and what each may do (D46). Comment lines are removed at start-up,
# and each {{name}} is replaced with that user's password from the valkey-passwords Secret (D50).
# ~pattern: read and write matching keys. %R~pattern: read only. +command: allowed command.
# The runner's commands are those in apps/runner/src/store.ts; the web server's are settled when it is written.
user default off
user runner on >{{runner}} ~session:* ~slots ~spend:* ~sleeping:* %R~presence %R~watching:* +xadd +xrevrange +expire +get +set +incrbyfloat +exists +ping

user web on >{{web}} %R~session:* %R~slots ~presence ~watching:* +xread +xrange +xrevrange +set +ping
user probe on nopass +ping
user admin on >{{admin}} ~* &* +@all
